  - key: privacy
    values:
    - Privacy
    - Privacidad
  - key: privacy_text
    values:
    - 'Little Burger World works completely offline.

      It does not collect,
      store or share any personal information.

      There are no ads, no purchases,
      no accounts, no analytics and no third-party tracking.

      Progress (stars,
      stickers and settings) is saved only on this device and can be erased with
      "Reset progress".'
    - "Little Burger World funciona totalmente sin conexi\xF3n.\nNo recopila, guarda
      ni comparte informaci\xF3n personal.\nNo hay anuncios, compras, cuentas, anal\xEDticas
      ni rastreo de terceros.\nEl progreso (estrellas, pegatinas y ajustes) se guarda
      solo en este dispositivo y se puede borrar con \"Reiniciar progreso\"."
  - key: stickers
    values:
    - Stickers
    - Pegatinas
